 // Needs to stay in sync with compiler-builtins
 
+// The `cfg`s here are for the *host*, which is correct only because the JIT can only ever run
+// code for the host. `cmp_result_ty` below is the equivalent for AOT compilation and has to look
+// at the target instead.
+
 // Aarch64 uses `int` rather than a pointer-sized value.
 #[cfg(any(target_arch = "aarch64", target_arch = "arm64ec"))]
